    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arna</span></b> , ae, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Umbria</i>,
				<i>a mile east of Perusia</i>, now <i>Civitella d'Arno</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 8, 458</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 91</span></i>; cf. Mann. Ital. I.
			483.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arnātes</span></b> , um, m., <i>the inhabitants of Arna</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 14,
				19, § 113</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
				90</span></i> and 5005.</div>
